---
import DirectionLayout from '../../../layouts/DirectionLayout.astro';
---
<DirectionLayout title="溫柔陪伴｜助人服務方向 07" description="適合關係導向、善於傾聽與低壓邀請的陪伴者服務首頁。">
  <main id="main" class="co-site">
    <header class="co-header"><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'layouts/'} class="co-logo">小小來信 <span>LETTER / 07</span></a><nav><a href="#letter">寫給你的信</a><a href="#how">我們怎麼一起工作</a><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'layouts/'}>看其他樣子 ↗</a></nav><a class="co-postmark" href="#contact">寄一封信</a></header>
    <section class="co-hero"><div class="co-hero-copy"><p class="co-kicker">A NOTE FOR THE DAYS THAT FEEL FULL</p><h1>你可以先從<br /><i>想說的那一小段開始。</i></h1><p>不需要準備好一個完整的故事。願意停一下、把最近的感受說出來，就已經是一個開始。</p><a href="#letter" class="co-open">讀一封寫給你的信 <span>↓</span></a><div class="co-hero-sign">慢慢來，<br />我們有時間。</div></div><figure><img src="https://tenwebs-6qkx6x5p.manus.space/images/directions/c-companion.webp" alt="午後光線下的沙發、茶杯與安靜角落" /><figcaption>給自己一個可以坐下來的地方。</figcaption></figure><span class="co-flower" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></section>
    <article class="co-letter" id="letter"><div class="co-letter-meta"><span>一封沒有催促的信</span><span>寫給正在想著要不要聯絡的人</span><span>2026 / 秋</span></div><div class="co-letter-body"><p class="co-dear">你好，</p><p>如果你來到這裡，可能已經在心裡想過幾次：現在適合找人談談嗎？我會不會需要先把事情整理得很清楚？</p><p>你不必先有答案，也不用把自己準備成一個「很會求助的人」。我們可以從此刻最接近你的那件事開始，慢慢看它想告訴你什麼。</p><p>第一次談話會先確認你希望得到什麼、我可以提供什麼，以及我們是否適合一起工作。你可以只問問題，也可以在談完之後再決定。</p><p class="co-signoff">願你今天有一點空間，<br />陪伴者的名字</p><p class="co-fineprint">正式上線時，請替換成站長本人文字，並清楚說明資格、服務範圍、費用與緊急狀況的求助方式。</p></div></article>
    <section class="co-how" id="how"><p class="co-kicker">A LITTLE MORE ABOUT THE PROCESS</p><h2>不用急著預約，<br /><i>先知道會發生什麼。</i></h2><div class="co-how-row"><article><span>01</span><h3>先寫下問題</h3><p>可以只問流程、費用和服務是否適合。</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>一起理解期待</h3><p>初次會談先談彼此的期待與界線。</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>把選擇留給你</h3><p>談完再決定要不要繼續，沒有催促。</p></article></div><a href="#contact" class="co-invite">留一個一般問題 <span>↗</span></a></section>
    <section class="co-contact" id="contact"><div><p class="co-kicker">A QUIET WAY TO BEGIN</p><h2>如果你願意，<br />我們可以從一封信開始。</h2></div><p>這是視覺原型，尚未連接安全表單。正式服務請使用合規聯絡方式；不要透過公開網站收集敏感健康資訊。</p><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'layouts/'}>比較另外九種網站方向 ↗</a></section>
    <footer class="co-footer"><span>小小來信 / 陪伴者服務示意</span><span>每段故事都可以有自己的速度。</span></footer>
  </main>
</DirectionLayout>
<style>
.co-site{--co-ink:#4b312d;--co-rose:#c57e6e;--co-paper:#fbf5ed;--co-warm:#f1e2d6;min-height:100vh;background:var(--co-paper);color:var(--co-ink);padding:0 clamp(1rem,5vw,5rem) 2rem;font-family:Georgia,"Noto Serif TC",serif}.co-header{height:86px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #e4d3c7;gap:1rem}.co-logo{text-decoration:none;font-size:1.3rem;letter-spacing:.04em}.co-logo span{display:block;font: .53rem ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#705149}.co-header nav{display:flex;gap:1.4rem;font-size:.73rem}.co-header nav a{text-decoration:none}.co-postmark{padding:.6rem .95rem;border:1px solid var(--co-rose);color:#8f554a;text-decoration:none;border-radius:50%;font-size:.7rem;transform:rotate(-5deg)}.co-hero{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:6vw;align-items:center;padding:5rem 0 6rem;position:relative}.co-kicker{font: .63rem ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#7c4d43}.co-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.3rem,6.8vw,6.4rem);line-height:1.07;letter-spacing:-.07em;font-weight:400;margin:.8rem 0 1.3rem}.co-hero h1 i,.co-how h2 i{font-weight:400;color:#9f5e53}.co-hero-copy>p:not(.co-kicker){font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.95;color:#745a53;max-width:480px}.co-open{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;color:#8f554a;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--co-rose);padding-bottom:.5rem;font-size:.75rem}.co-open span{margin-left:1rem}.co-hero figure{margin:0;position:relative}.co-hero figure img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover;border-radius:44% 44% 4px 4px}.co-hero figcaption{text-align:right;font-size:.68rem;color:#6f5049;margin-top:.6rem}.co-hero-sign{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:-3.2rem;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#7c4d43;transform:rotate(-4deg)}.co-flower{position:absolute;top:19%;right:43%;font-size:3rem;color:#d69e8f;opacity:.7}.co-letter{max-width:1030px;margin:0 auto 6rem;background:#f1e6dc;padding:1.2rem clamp(1.2rem,6vw,5rem) 3rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.6fr 1.4fr;gap:5vw;position:relative}.co-letter::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:50%;top:0;bottom:0;border-left:1px dashed #d2b7aa}.co-letter-meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;font: .62rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:#6f534c;line-height:1.6}.co-letter-body{max-width:610px;font-size:1.03rem;line-height:2.1;color:#624843}.co-dear{font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:0}.co-signoff{margin-top:2rem;color:#8f554a}.co-fineprint{border-top:1px solid #d4beb1;padding-top:.8rem;font: .6rem/1.7 ui-monospace,monospace;color:#6c514a}.co-how{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto 6rem;text-align:center}.co-how h2{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,6vw,5rem);line-height:1.05;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.07em;margin:1rem 0 3rem}.co-how-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);text-align:left;border-top:1px solid #dcc8bc;border-bottom:1px solid #dcc8bc}.co-how-row article{padding:1.3rem 1.2rem}.co-how-row article+article{border-left:1px solid #dcc8bc}.co-how-row span{font: .65rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:#7a4e42}.co-how-row h3{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:400}.co-how-row p{font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.7;color:#644b45}.co-invite{display:inline-block;margin-top:2rem;border:1px solid var(--co-rose);border-radius:40px;padding:.8rem 1.3rem;text-decoration:none;color:#8f554a;font-size:.75rem}.co-invite span{margin-left:1rem}.co-contact{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto 2rem;padding:2rem 0;border-top:1px solid #decfc4;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr auto;gap:2rem;align-items:end}.co-contact h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.7rem);font-weight:400;line-height:1.05;margin:.5rem 0}.co-contact>p{font-size:.73rem;line-height:1.8;color:#654e47;max-width:420px}.co-contact>a{font-size:.67rem;color:#8f554a}.co-footer{border-top:1px solid #decfc4;padding:1rem 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font: .6rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:#6c514a}@media(max-width:800px){.co-header{height:auto;padding:1rem 0;flex-wrap:wrap}.co-header nav{order:3;width:100%;justify-content:space-between}.co-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:3.5rem 0 5rem;gap:2rem}.co-hero figure{width:82%;margin-left:auto}.co-flower{right:7%;top:42%}.co-letter{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}.co-letter::before{display:none}.co-letter-meta{flex-direction:row;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:1px dashed #d2b7aa;padding-bottom:.8rem}.co-contact{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.co-contact>a{grid-column:1/-1}}@media(max-width:540px){.co-header nav{gap:.6rem;font-size:.64rem}.co-postmark{font-size:.61rem}.co-hero h1{font-size:14vw}.co-hero figure{width:100%}.co-hero-sign{bottom:-3.6rem}.co-how-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.co-how-row article+article{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #dcc8bc}.co-contact{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.5rem}.co-contact>a{grid-column:auto}.co-footer{flex-direction:column;gap:.5rem}}
</style>